1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,120
Roxgold SiteLife.
Logging in and getting started.

2
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:10,830
My next trip? Has my request been approved?
Information is often scattered.

3
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:15,150
And without a personal space,
everyone has to ask around.

4
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:21,790
With Roxgold SiteLife, your personal space
brings everything together, on your phone.

5
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:28,830
On iPhone, open the app in Safari: it shows you
how to add it to your home screen.

6
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,220
Enter your username and your password,

7
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:35,510
then tap Log in.

8
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:44,060
Depending on your site's settings,
logging in with an SMS code may also be offered.

9
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:51,080
You land on your home screen: your next trip,
its date, its time and the countdown.

10
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:57,210
The shortcuts take you straight
to the pages of your menu.

11
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:05,040
Further down: your requests,
pending and approved.

12
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:16,510
At the bottom of the screen, the tab bar:
Home, Trips, Requests, Meals, Report.

13
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:23,390
More opens all your pages.
At the bottom: My account and Log out.

14
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:30,390
My account shows your profile
and the language choice: French or English.

15
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:35,460
In the Security tab,
you can change your password.

16
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:43,520
Enter your current password,
then the new one, twice.

17
00:01:43,570 --> 00:01:47,610
The gauge shows its strength.
Tap Change the password.

18
00:01:48,660 --> 00:01:52,210
You are then logged out:
log in again with the new password.

19
00:01:55,660 --> 00:01:59,730
Everything in one place, on your phone,
with a protected account.

20
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:04,490
After fifteen minutes without activity,
the app logs you out automatically.

21
00:02:05,660 --> 00:02:08,770
Roxgold SiteLife.
Welcome to your space.
